WEBVTT

00:02.335 --> 00:03.253
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:07.590 --> 00:10.802
<i>Mitsuya is... dead.</i>

00:20.145 --> 00:22.439
<i>It can't be. It can't!</i>

00:22.522 --> 00:25.775
<i>There's absolutely no way
that Mitsuya could be dead.</i>

00:37.537 --> 00:41.166
-TOKYO MANJI GANG OFFICER FOUND STRANGLED
-BODY IDENTIFIED AS TAKASHI MITSUYA

00:44.627 --> 00:45.462
There's no way.

00:46.546 --> 00:48.631
<i>There must be some mistake.</i>

00:49.883 --> 00:51.843
<i>How could this happen?!</i>

00:57.849 --> 01:00.477
HINATA TACHIBANA DIES IN
POSSIBLE GANG-RELATED CAR ACCIDENT

01:00.560 --> 01:03.313
<i>Hina's... dead too?</i>

01:06.149 --> 01:07.442
<i>It's the same as before.</i>

01:09.277 --> 01:10.153
<i>Nothing...</i>

01:10.820 --> 01:12.614
<i>Nothing's changed at all, damn it!</i>

01:13.156 --> 01:14.532
<i>What the hell is going on?!</i>

01:28.171 --> 01:29.172
Damn it!

01:31.007 --> 01:32.801
Damn it! Damn it!

01:33.760 --> 01:35.261
Chifuyu!

01:35.345 --> 01:36.638
Naoto!

01:37.222 --> 01:39.349
Where the hell have you all gone?

01:44.813 --> 01:45.814
A key?

01:49.484 --> 01:52.487
This is the key to the rundown apartment

01:54.280 --> 01:55.615
<i>where I used to live.</i>

02:08.753 --> 02:10.421
<i>It smells like my place.</i>

02:12.924 --> 02:15.718
<i>So, this is where I live.</i>

02:19.055 --> 02:20.431
Instead of a high-rise condo,

02:21.641 --> 02:23.226
I'm back here again.

02:24.769 --> 02:27.021
But why?

02:32.527 --> 02:34.696
It's the last photo
I took of us as a group.

02:36.447 --> 02:37.490
So here you are.

02:39.534 --> 02:40.660
I've been looking for you.

02:42.620 --> 02:45.748
My memories were overwritten,

02:45.832 --> 02:48.293
so I knew you'd returned.

02:49.586 --> 02:50.879
Naoto!

02:50.962 --> 02:51.963
I'm coming in.

02:54.465 --> 02:55.633
Takemichi.

02:55.717 --> 02:56.801
What...

02:56.885 --> 02:59.721
What the heck's happening, Naoto?

03:00.805 --> 03:03.391
Until now, you've traveled
back to the past several times

03:04.184 --> 03:06.394
to save my sister.

03:07.270 --> 03:10.899
But this timeline is the worst one yet.

03:13.484 --> 03:15.862
The worst one yet?

03:15.945 --> 03:16.821
That's right.

03:17.739 --> 03:19.908
Not only has my sister not been saved,

03:20.867 --> 03:23.411
but all the major members
of Tokyo Manji Gang...

03:24.120 --> 03:25.663
have been murdered.

03:26.206 --> 03:27.165
What?

03:32.837 --> 03:35.173
TOKYO REVENGERS

05:00.717 --> 05:03.177
Chifuyu Matsuno, shot and killed.

05:03.678 --> 05:06.139
Hakkai Shiba, burned to death.

05:07.140 --> 05:09.100
Takashi Mitsuya, strangled to death.

05:10.101 --> 05:12.061
Ken Ryuguji, stabbed to death.

05:12.562 --> 05:18.109
Kazutora Hanemiya, Haruki Hayashida,
and all the others have been murdered too.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.237
Even Kisaki's been murdered.

05:21.821 --> 05:22.864
Even Kisaki?

05:24.490 --> 05:26.909
They're... all dead.

05:29.871 --> 05:32.540
How... is this possible?

05:32.623 --> 05:34.208
We haven't caught the culprit.

05:34.792 --> 05:37.211
We don't even have a lead
as to where they are.

05:39.130 --> 05:40.173
What about Mikey?

05:40.673 --> 05:43.676
Don't tell me Mikey's been murdered too!

05:45.261 --> 05:48.389
Brace yourself for this, Takemichi.

05:48.473 --> 05:49.599
Huh?

05:49.682 --> 05:50.850
At present,

05:50.933 --> 05:54.395
the person wanted for these murders is...

05:55.271 --> 05:56.773
Manjiro Sano.

05:59.942 --> 06:00.777
What?

06:02.028 --> 06:04.739
You've got a sick sense of humor,
you bastard.

06:05.740 --> 06:07.450
That's impossible!

06:07.533 --> 06:11.913
There's no way in hell
that Mikey would kill all those guys.

06:12.997 --> 06:14.040
Hey!

06:16.084 --> 06:19.712
Takemichi, I also want to know the truth.

06:20.755 --> 06:22.840
I want to meet Manjiro Sano
and talk to him.

06:23.883 --> 06:25.885
But you're the only one who can do that.

06:27.136 --> 06:29.263
Though you're an officer
in Tokyo Manji Gang,

06:29.347 --> 06:32.350
you're the only one
who hasn't been murdered.

06:36.479 --> 06:37.688
Mikey...

06:38.481 --> 06:40.191
<i>The Mikey that I know,</i>

06:40.274 --> 06:41.943
<i>would he really kill all the guys...</i>

06:43.403 --> 06:44.612
in Toman?

06:45.613 --> 06:46.447
Naoto...

06:47.573 --> 06:49.492
Was it really Mikey who did it?

06:50.535 --> 06:53.871
Can you think of anything
that might point to why he did it?

06:53.955 --> 06:54.789
Huh?

06:54.872 --> 06:57.875
The last time you traveled back in time,

06:57.959 --> 07:00.837
you must have learned something
that can help us.

07:02.130 --> 07:03.047
One thing's for sure.

07:03.548 --> 07:07.510
Something you did in the past has made
a big difference in this timeline.

07:09.220 --> 07:10.596
Something I did?

07:10.680 --> 07:13.224
Are you saying I screwed up?

07:13.307 --> 07:16.144
<i>Me and the other guys...</i>

07:16.227 --> 07:19.939
<i>We eliminated the two things
that ruined Toman.</i>

07:20.022 --> 07:21.816
<i>We crushed BLACK DRAGON</i>

07:21.899 --> 07:24.694
<i>and Kisaki was kicked out of Toman.</i>

07:25.236 --> 07:28.030
Everything went perfectly!

07:28.114 --> 07:29.449
Takemichi...

07:29.532 --> 07:30.992
What went wrong?

07:31.492 --> 07:36.789
Was it wrong for me to tell Mikey
that he could handle things on his own?

07:37.665 --> 07:39.542
The only other thing I did...

07:40.209 --> 07:42.253
was take this photo.

07:44.297 --> 07:47.967
Takemichi, where was that photo?

07:48.050 --> 07:49.010
Where?

07:49.969 --> 07:51.262
On this table.

07:53.639 --> 07:54.682
A letter.

07:55.516 --> 07:58.895
The photo must have been
in here with this.

08:02.148 --> 08:04.567
Let me see that letter.

08:04.650 --> 08:06.110
Oh, sure.

08:08.488 --> 08:11.240
This isn't a Japanese postmark.

08:11.741 --> 08:13.117
It's from the Philippines.

08:13.201 --> 08:14.452
The Philippines?

08:19.749 --> 08:21.292
MEET ME ON JANUARY 20TH
AT THE PLACE I TOLD YOU ABOUT.

08:21.375 --> 08:24.253
Who sent this letter?

08:26.797 --> 08:27.882
<i>Whose writing is this?</i>

08:29.425 --> 08:31.469
<i>And what's the "place I told you about"?</i>

08:32.470 --> 08:33.304
Huh?

08:38.017 --> 08:39.227
Oh...

08:41.354 --> 08:45.316
My brother found them
when he was traveling to buy parts.

08:45.816 --> 08:49.028
It was in some town in the Philippines.

08:49.111 --> 08:50.780
<i>It's from Mikey.</i>

09:05.670 --> 09:07.964
This is the address
that was written on the envelope.

09:11.551 --> 09:12.885
It's pretty big.

09:14.220 --> 09:15.137
Let's split up.

09:16.138 --> 09:17.974
Please be very careful.

09:19.058 --> 09:19.934
Okay.

09:25.064 --> 09:26.899
<i>There's no guarantee he's here.</i>

09:27.900 --> 09:31.862
<i>But if I do meet him,
it'll be the first time</i>

09:32.446 --> 09:34.824
<i>that I meet the future Mikey.</i>

09:36.158 --> 09:37.577
<i>I wonder what he's like.</i>

09:38.744 --> 09:40.204
<i>Is he still the same?</i>

09:41.038 --> 09:43.082
<i>What'll we talk about when we meet?</i>

09:45.084 --> 09:46.919
These ruins are huge.

09:47.878 --> 09:49.130
<i>Is he the same?</i>

09:49.672 --> 09:51.257
<i>No, he must have changed.</i>

09:51.841 --> 09:54.260
<i>I mean, he's probably
murdered all those guys.</i>

09:55.428 --> 09:59.223
<i>The Mikey here
isn't the Mikey that I knew.</i>

09:59.890 --> 10:04.228
<i>After 12 years,
Mikey could be totally different.</i>

10:05.313 --> 10:06.981
<i>I impulsively came here,</i>

10:07.732 --> 10:09.859
<i>but when I think about it,
I could be in danger.</i>

10:09.942 --> 10:12.361
<i>He might kill me as soon as he sees me.</i>

10:12.945 --> 10:15.615
<i>In fact, he could have led me here
just to murder me.</i>

10:18.951 --> 10:19.910
<i>Should I go back?</i>

10:24.957 --> 10:26.000
What's that?

10:30.588 --> 10:33.424
<i>The sky was a suffocating gray.</i>

10:35.551 --> 10:39.263
<i>In an abandoned building
with a broken roof.</i>

10:44.393 --> 10:46.520
<i>"The place I told you about."</i>

10:48.314 --> 10:49.565
<i>This is it!</i>

10:50.900 --> 10:54.654
<i>This is the place where Mikey's brother
found the CB250T engines.</i>

10:55.404 --> 10:57.823
<i>This is... kind of moving.</i>

10:59.533 --> 11:00.534
Takemitchy.

11:25.393 --> 11:27.770
Mikey...

11:31.816 --> 11:32.817
Mikey.

11:35.111 --> 11:37.488
<i>When I met Mikey
for the first time in the present,</i>

11:38.489 --> 11:40.700
<i>his eyes were the same
as they were back then.</i>

11:42.451 --> 11:44.662
Uh, so...

11:45.746 --> 11:48.332
-How have you been?
-<i>At last, I've found him.</i>

11:49.583 --> 11:50.626
Good.

11:50.710 --> 11:53.212
-<i>At last... At last...</i>
-Uhm...

11:55.881 --> 11:59.927
<i>I've found... Mikey.</i>

12:00.010 --> 12:01.011
Uhm...

12:03.472 --> 12:04.432
I'm sorry.

12:06.392 --> 12:08.310
Still a crybaby, I see.

12:18.320 --> 12:21.699
I called you all the way here
because I have a favor to ask.

12:21.782 --> 12:22.616
Huh?

12:23.325 --> 12:24.160
A favor?

12:26.954 --> 12:30.541
When I came here
and thought about my brother,

12:31.208 --> 12:33.085
all kinds of memories came rushing back.

12:34.211 --> 12:36.672
I fought lots of guys when I was a kid.

12:37.757 --> 12:39.300
I made friends, and I laughed...

12:40.760 --> 12:41.969
and cried with them.

12:42.970 --> 12:46.098
I realized that's how Toman grew.

12:47.892 --> 12:49.351
I felt nostalgic.

12:51.604 --> 12:52.646
Mikey.

12:54.064 --> 12:55.733
<i>Now that I've seen him, I'm sure.</i>

12:56.734 --> 12:58.944
<i>Mikey is still Mikey.</i>

12:59.653 --> 13:03.115
<i>There's no way
he murdered Mitsuya or the others.</i>

13:03.741 --> 13:06.368
<i>The Mikey of Toman could never kill them.</i>

13:09.997 --> 13:11.916
Toman changed.

13:17.671 --> 13:18.756
Takemitchy.

13:21.467 --> 13:23.844
Why did you leave Toman?

13:24.345 --> 13:25.179
Huh?

13:26.931 --> 13:28.474
I wanted you to stay with me.

13:30.142 --> 13:32.186
I wanted you to scold me
like my brother did.

13:34.939 --> 13:36.607
I did my best on my own.

13:38.275 --> 13:39.944
But I couldn't hold it back.

13:41.445 --> 13:43.239
I couldn't stop from losing myself.

13:44.865 --> 13:48.744
Mikey, what do you mean by that?

13:48.828 --> 13:52.039
When I tried to stop you
from leaving Toman,

13:52.790 --> 13:54.959
this is what Draken told me.

13:57.795 --> 13:59.255
Don't, Mikey.

13:59.338 --> 14:00.589
Huh?

14:00.673 --> 14:02.800
You trying to order me around?

14:05.678 --> 14:07.888
I agree with Draken.

14:09.515 --> 14:10.349
Mitsuya.

14:10.850 --> 14:13.602
He's not suited for what Toman's becoming.

14:20.901 --> 14:21.902
Mikey...

14:21.986 --> 14:25.447
The path you've chosen is one of violence.

14:26.448 --> 14:30.160
Mitsuya and I entrust our lives
to you on this path.

14:30.744 --> 14:31.704
We've made up our minds.

14:32.454 --> 14:33.622
But Mikey...

14:34.832 --> 14:37.167
We're indebted to Takemitchy.

14:38.002 --> 14:39.837
I don't want him to turn out like us.

14:41.088 --> 14:43.507
Leave him out of this.

14:49.471 --> 14:52.349
Those two said those things?

14:52.850 --> 14:53.684
Yeah.

14:54.518 --> 14:56.228
They're the best, don't you think?

14:57.104 --> 14:58.230
But it was those guys...

14:59.690 --> 15:01.025
that I killed.

15:02.192 --> 15:03.319
What?

15:04.695 --> 15:05.779
Takemitchy.

15:06.697 --> 15:08.574
Toman isn't like it was back then.

15:09.992 --> 15:12.828
Those guys, every last one of them...

15:14.872 --> 15:16.081
I killed them all.

15:17.917 --> 15:19.043
That's why I'm asking you.

15:19.543 --> 15:22.713
I want you to end it all.

15:31.764 --> 15:32.765
Takemitchy.

15:33.974 --> 15:34.892
Kill me.

15:49.031 --> 15:51.158
I want to end it all here.

15:51.992 --> 15:53.369
End my dream.

15:56.288 --> 16:00.167
What are you talking about, Mikey?

16:00.250 --> 16:04.129
Don't say that. It doesn't make any sense.

16:04.213 --> 16:07.341
As soon as I find you,
you tell me to kill you?

16:08.342 --> 16:11.637
I only came here
because I wanted to see you.

16:12.805 --> 16:14.431
Because you wanted to see me?

16:15.557 --> 16:18.435
Hakkai said something similar
just before he died.

16:27.987 --> 16:28.988
Mikey...

16:29.571 --> 16:33.867
I wanted all of us to have a blast
with Takemitchy one last time.

16:38.080 --> 16:41.083
Just before Hakkai died?

16:45.129 --> 16:47.381
It's not easy to achieve a dream.

16:48.382 --> 16:49.967
I said I'd build a new era for hoodlums.

16:51.010 --> 16:54.179
Toman was supposed to be
advancing toward that goal.

16:55.597 --> 16:59.476
But before I knew it,
things had turned out like this.

17:00.144 --> 17:01.186
Like what?

17:02.396 --> 17:04.189
The first time I killed someone...

17:10.487 --> 17:12.031
I didn't feel a thing.

17:13.866 --> 17:15.159
Then I realized something.

17:15.659 --> 17:21.331
Pretty much all the troubles in life
can be easily solved by killing someone.

17:24.084 --> 17:26.795
I can just kill anyone who gets in my way.

17:28.839 --> 17:31.091
You're wrong, Mikey!

17:31.175 --> 17:33.427
You haven't changed, Mikey!

17:33.510 --> 17:35.095
You're the same as you were then!

17:35.179 --> 17:37.806
Cut it out, Takemitchy.

17:37.890 --> 17:40.100
I can tell when I look into your eyes.

17:40.184 --> 17:42.144
You haven't changed at all.

17:42.227 --> 17:43.145
Stop it.

17:43.228 --> 17:44.521
You haven't changed.

17:44.605 --> 17:48.442
So please, please, stop all this killing!

17:53.781 --> 17:55.783
What the hell are you?

18:03.665 --> 18:06.668
Got any last words, Chifuyu?

18:10.798 --> 18:13.300
Do you remember Takemichi Hanagaki?

18:14.343 --> 18:17.596
Someday, he'll come
looking for you, Mikey.

18:18.222 --> 18:19.681
When he finds you,

18:20.432 --> 18:23.644
he'll be like he was back then
as if he'd traveled through time.

18:25.229 --> 18:27.773
Look closely into his eyes.

18:28.816 --> 18:31.610
His eyes never lie.

18:33.320 --> 18:34.154
Please...

18:35.447 --> 18:37.282
Trust him.

18:40.536 --> 18:42.955
Quit looking at me that way.

18:46.959 --> 18:48.085
<i>Mikey.</i>

18:48.752 --> 18:51.380
Pick up the gun, Takemitchy.

18:52.506 --> 18:53.674
Either you kill me...

18:55.259 --> 18:56.760
or you die.

19:09.898 --> 19:11.817
We can't return to the past.

19:29.585 --> 19:31.545
Are you all right, Takemichi?

19:32.796 --> 19:33.672
Naoto...

19:38.510 --> 19:40.012
Mikey.

19:41.221 --> 19:42.723
Mikey!

19:43.557 --> 19:44.808
Mikey!

19:44.892 --> 19:47.060
Takemichi, stay away from him!

19:50.147 --> 19:51.940
<i>The safety's on.</i>

19:52.858 --> 19:54.484
He wasn't going to kill him?

19:54.985 --> 19:57.654
Mikey! Mikey!

20:04.536 --> 20:06.371
Mikey!

20:07.956 --> 20:10.542
Is that you, Naoto Tachibana?

20:10.626 --> 20:11.752
Huh?

20:12.628 --> 20:14.087
Thank you.

20:14.838 --> 20:19.051
I doubt Takemitchy could have done it.

20:19.551 --> 20:20.928
Mikey!

20:22.262 --> 20:24.848
At last, it's over.

20:26.099 --> 20:30.437
My life was nothing but suffering.

20:31.063 --> 20:34.107
Don't talk like that, Mikey.

20:35.525 --> 20:38.153
I can change things.

20:38.237 --> 20:39.321
Takemichi.

20:39.404 --> 20:41.865
I can travel back to the past.

20:41.949 --> 20:43.116
I can do things over.

20:43.617 --> 20:47.829
I'll do whatever it takes
to make sure this isn't our future.

20:48.330 --> 20:51.667
I swear that I'll never give up.

20:51.750 --> 20:56.213
So don't say such depressing things.

20:58.757 --> 21:01.260
Thank you, Takemitchy.

21:01.343 --> 21:02.177
Huh?

21:02.844 --> 21:04.888
You're trying to comfort me.

21:06.974 --> 21:08.600
Even if it's a lie, it makes me happy.

21:12.354 --> 21:13.522
Takemitchy.

21:14.731 --> 21:15.565
Yeah?

21:16.775 --> 21:17.859
Your hand...

21:20.153 --> 21:21.363
It's so warm.

21:29.746 --> 21:30.872
Mikey...

21:31.623 --> 21:32.791
This can't be real.

21:32.874 --> 21:34.334
Answer me.

21:35.335 --> 21:37.879
Please, Mikey!

21:44.886 --> 21:45.804
Takemitchy...

21:46.430 --> 21:48.056
Starting today, we're friends.

21:48.140 --> 21:49.057
Okay?

21:49.141 --> 21:52.769
I'm going to build a new era for hoodlums.

21:52.853 --> 21:53.854
Boo!

21:54.938 --> 21:57.607
You're tough, Takemitchy.

22:05.407 --> 22:06.408
Takemichi.

23:38.375 --> 23:40.377
Translation by Brian Athey
